              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0001"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[0]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "免责声明：  以下文章的著作权等各种权利归原作者所有，翻译 By SeventhTG（XD）。如果你喜欢本文并有幸让你产生了转载的想法，请注明原作者、原文地址以及译者，谢谢。 原文地址：http://beginners.biz/joukyou/joukyou08.html ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b2",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0002"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[1]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "这一节讲AL的立直判断。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b3",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0003"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[2]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "在AL，平常时候应该立直的牌根据状况不同也有需要自重的时候。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b4",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0004"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[3]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "因为有时候你会白白扔一根棒子顺位反而下降。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b5",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0005"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[4]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "例1："
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b6",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0006"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[5]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
            "figureId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b6",
            "unitId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-argument",
            "page": null,
            "locator": {
              "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
              "sourceBlockIds": [
                "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0006"
              ],
              "domPaths": [
                "main/div[5]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
              ]
            },
            "caption": "例1：南4局1本场，北家34300点的牌局。",
            "imageSha256": "55e1e049e9fbb988adae5bc570c28e55c27a6ff32185e7de40213f447ef47b9a",
            "imageProvenance": {
              "kind": "derived-source-assets",
              "method": "source-order-horizontal-RGBA-bottom-aligned-no-gap",
              "sourceAssetSha256s": [
                "6e4188d52ce94199635d25c0f87899bef3a2386616e6180657e10b447e726ee0"
              ]
            },
            "transcription": {
              "text": "中央：南4局1本场；立直供托0根；“宝牌”标签右侧为5p。\n点数位置：下方北家（4z）34300点；右方东家（1z）16700点；上方南家（2z）31300点；左方西家（3z）17700点。\n下方手牌从左到右：2s 3s 4s 4s 7s 8s 2p 2p 3p 4p 6m 7m 8m；最右侧分开的摸入牌：6s。\n下方弃牌从左到右：3z 4z 2m 7z 6p 5z。\n上方弃牌：靠中央一行从画面左到右为1p 2z 7m 5z 6z 1z；该行最右一张的上方另有7s。牌面朝向上方玩家。\n左方弃牌：靠中央一列从画面上到下为4z 9s 9m 2z 4m 8p；该列最上方一张的左侧另有1s。牌面相对画面顺时针旋转90度。\n右方弃牌：靠中央一列从画面上到下为1z 2m 1z 7z 4z 9m；该列最下方一张的右侧另有4z。牌面相对画面逆时针旋转90度。\n暗手牌背：上方13张，左方13张，右方13张。未见赤牌。"
            },
            "requiresImageForFullExample": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b7",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0007"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[7]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "特别是自己TOP迎来AL的情况。我们的目标是避免无效的立直结束牌局。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b8",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0008"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[8]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "例1的牌2、5饼立直做满贯是平场的打法。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b9",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0009"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[9]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "现在这样的点数状况就要默听，而且选择容易被打出的1、4索才是绝对的正确答案。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b10",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0010"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[10]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "理论、总结："
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b11",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0011"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[11]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "AL自己TOP有役听牌应该默听。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b12",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0012"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[12]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "如果别人的牌只是没什么翻盘机会的食断的话，有时候有役也可以立，铳了也没关系。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b13",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0013"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[13]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "不过这样的话就要有被第二位满贯直击也无法逆转的点差（自己扔棒子的话就要18000点），这样的机会根本就不怎么多。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b14",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0014"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[14]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b15",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0015"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[15]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "例2："
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b16",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0016"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[16]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
            "figureId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b16",
            "unitId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-argument",
            "page": null,
            "locator": {
              "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
              "sourceBlockIds": [
                "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0016"
              ],
              "domPaths": [
                "main/div[16]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
              ]
            },
            "caption": "例2：南4局0本场，东家31700点，对家（上方西家）已有5p 6p 7p副露。",
            "imageSha256": "0e247a5f8a27ca0bca25f447fb4a0fb5aad511e345b7b656e8190f850b4ad70c",
            "imageProvenance": {
              "kind": "derived-source-assets",
              "method": "source-order-horizontal-RGBA-bottom-aligned-no-gap",
              "sourceAssetSha256s": [
                "1f763b6fa772080e64a8d6e4e11d6f85d2147bfd1a8aacce6216e2f1e3054dce"
              ]
            },
            "transcription": {
              "text": "中央：南4局0本场；立直供托0根；“宝牌”标签右侧为6p。\n点数位置：下方东家（1z）31700点；右方南家（2z）22300点；上方西家（3z）30000点；左方北家（4z）26000点。\n下方手牌从左到右共13张：1m 2m 3m 4m 4m 5m 6m 4p 5s 6s 7s 8s 9s；最右侧分开的摸入牌为6z。\n画面左上方的副露属于上方西家（对家）：从画面左到右为5p 6p 7p，其中7p横置，另外两张竖放；整组朝向上方玩家。\n上方弃牌：靠中央一行从画面左到右为7s 1m 5z 9p 9s 1z；该行最右两张的上方，从画面左到右另有1p和一张数字不明的万子。牌面朝向上方玩家。\n左方弃牌：靠中央一列从画面上到下为1p 3z 4z 4z 6z 5z；该列最上方一张的左侧另有1s，第二张的左侧另有3m。牌面相对画面顺时针旋转90度。\n右方弃牌：靠中央一列从画面上到下为[索子，数字不明] 7z 6z 2z 1z 4z；该列最下方一张的右侧另有5m。牌面相对画面逆时针旋转90度。\n下方弃牌：第一行从画面左到右为5z 9m 3z 8p 1s 2s；第二行位于第一行最左两张下方，从左到右为1p 2z。\n暗手牌背：上方10张，左方13张，右方13张。未见赤牌。\n原图未显示的信息：上方弃牌第二行最右一张，即1p右侧的万子：数字无法可靠辨认。；右方弃牌靠中央一列最上方一张：可辨为索子，数字无法可靠辨认。"
            },
            "requiresImageForFullExample": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b17",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0017"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[18]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "AL自己TOP应该果断进攻的情况就是很容易被第二位逆转的时候。和第二位微差自己还扔棒子自然很容易被逆转。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b18",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0018"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[19]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "但是例2这样的情况自己立直就没什么问题，毕竟对家已经满足了逆转的条件了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b19",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0019"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[20]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "虽然4、7万可以默听和牌，但是更容易被打出的1万却因为没役不能和。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b20",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0020"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[21]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "正在做食断的对家很有可能打出1万，即使默听，也没有什么有效的牌能够改变这样的状况了。所以这牌应该干脆的立直。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b21",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0021"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[22]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "由于自己扔了棒子，可能会由于上下两家的自摸从而使自己的顺位下降。但是目前两家都还没有听牌，就不要想其他的，果断进攻！"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "limited256-1",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0021"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[22]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【审校范围（非原文）1】保留该位置的万子数字不明标记，不推补具体牌码。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "limited256-2",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0021"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[22]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【审校范围（非原文）2】该牌可能影响1万、4万或7万的可见张数，不能据此精确核算剩余张数或验证1万更容易被打出的判断。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "limited256-3",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0021"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[22]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【审校范围（非原文）3】对家做食断及已满足逆转条件应保留为作者的论述，不能当作已由可见牌面证实的暗手事实。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "limited256-4",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0021"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[22]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【审校范围（非原文）4】保留该位置的索子数字不明标记，不推补具体牌码。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "limited256-5",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0021"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[22]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【审校范围（非原文）5】不能完整核算索子牌河、剩余张数或据此独立验证改良机会。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "limited256-6",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0021"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[22]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【审校范围（非原文）6】保留作者所写上下两家尚未听牌的前提；隐藏手牌和实际听牌状态不能由本图确认。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b22",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0022"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[23]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b23",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0023"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[24]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "例3："
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b24",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0024"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[25]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
            "figureId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b24",
            "unitId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-argument",
            "page": null,
            "locator": {
              "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
              "sourceBlockIds": [
                "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0024"
              ],
              "domPaths": [
                "main/div[25]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
              ]
            },
            "caption": "例3：南4局1本场，南家36000点，右家已有立直横置牌。",
            "imageSha256": "7d05f45764d07777d4f84dfc7600d484745044572d99368fa1672fcadeb00c5b",
            "imageProvenance": {
              "kind": "derived-source-assets",
              "method": "source-order-horizontal-RGBA-bottom-aligned-no-gap",
              "sourceAssetSha256s": [
                "f163b3f01345bf20fe6bf1d4943e07024893b77e46a02f573a193eacdbd7f514"
              ]
            },
            "transcription": {
              "text": "中央：南4局1本场；立直供托1根；“宝牌”标签右侧为3p。\n点数位置：下方南家（2z）36000点；右方西家（3z）10100点；上方北家（4z）17900点；左方东家（1z）35000点。\n下方手牌从左到右：3m 4m 7m 8m 9m 1p 2p 3p 6p 8p 7z 7z 7z；最右侧分开的摸入牌：7p。\n下方弃牌从左到右：4z 3z 2z 8s 9p。\n上方弃牌从画面左到右：2z 7z 9s 5z 3z。牌面朝向上方玩家。\n左方弃牌从画面上到下：4z 5z 4s 4p 3z 2m。牌面相对画面顺时针旋转90度。\n右方弃牌从画面上到下：6s 2m 3m 1z 9s。其中6s相对其余弃牌横置，在画面中呈竖放；其余牌面相对画面逆时针旋转90度。\n暗手牌背：上方13张，左方13张，右方13张。未见赤牌。"
            },
            "requiresImageForFullExample": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b25",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0025"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[27]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "例3讲如何应对4位的立直。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b26",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0026"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[28]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "切中保持默听是比较正点的一手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b27",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0027"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[29]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "不管下家自摸什么牌都终局了，根本没有必要与其正面对决。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b28",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0028"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[30]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "切掉中，自摸2、5万的就算走运了。摸到危险牌就继续拆中果断弃和。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b29",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0029"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[31]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "弃和基本上就保住TOP的状况还扔棒子简直是蠢到家了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b30",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0030"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[32]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b31",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0031"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[33]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "最后再讲讲涉及到改良默听的一些东西。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b32",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0032"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[34]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "AL应该期待改良听牌的情况很少，几乎都是期待一发或者里宝牌会更好一点。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b33",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0033"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[36]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "例4："
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b34",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0034"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[37]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
            "figureId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b34",
            "unitId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-argument",
            "page": null,
            "locator": {
              "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
              "sourceBlockIds": [
                "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0034"
              ],
              "domPaths": [
                "main/div[37]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
              ]
            },
            "caption": "例4：十三张手牌，另示摸入2p及宝牌3z。",
            "imageSha256": "eef7bddb7b60748f54bdba7a11c302818d96bb3927f8b5812457eeac91d8da31",
            "imageProvenance": {
              "kind": "derived-source-assets",
              "method": "source-order-horizontal-RGBA-bottom-aligned-no-gap",
              "sourceAssetSha256s": [
                "424ea9e309fda3bb0e4f73c8bd72650628bb8c7d92ed7536c139b2120b47cccf"
              ]
            },
            "transcription": {
              "text": "手牌从左到右：7m 8m 9m 1p 3p 6p 7p 2s 2s 3s 6s 7s 8s。\n手牌右侧为“摸入”标签，其右侧单独一张2p。\n再右侧为“宝牌”标签，其右侧单独一张3z。\n所有牌均竖放，未见赤牌。"
            },
            "requiresImageForFullExample": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b35",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0035"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[39]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "AL自己2位，差一手就能够三色听牌。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b36",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0036"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[40]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "一发中里宝或者自摸中1里宝就能够逆转的状况的话，即立是正确的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b37",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0037"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[41]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "特别是3900点以内的点差，默听是损失非常大的打法。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b38",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0038"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[42]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "和摸6万的概率相比，一发或者中里宝的概率要更大，这个大家用常识就可以知道的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b39",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0039"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[43]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "如果必须要自摸满贯的话，可以默听等摸6万改良。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b40",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0040"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[44]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "但是，在三色做成之前荣牌打出来当然是要和的。能够改良的牌只有一种，而且就算改良了也要和出高目。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b41",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0041"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[45]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "太过于期待这种苛刻的条件也是需要禁止的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1785770-b42",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1785770",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1785770:b0042"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[46]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "（待续）"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
